{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Charlotte en Espagne", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Que faire en ville ?", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 4, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Taking a Break > Toledo - A Spanish Jewel", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 5, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "L'apprenant fait usage d'une information pr\u00e9cise concernant les voyages et les vacances dans des situations sociales. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "L'apprenant identifie de l'information g\u00e9n\u00e9rale dans des conversations courtes \u00e0 l'\u00e9crit et \u00e0 l'oral concernant des conseils pour avoir une vie saine.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "L'apprenant identifie de l'information g\u00e9n\u00e9rale dans des conversations courtes \u00e0 l'\u00e9crit et \u00e0 l'oral concernant des conseils pour avoir une vie saine.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "L'apprenant identifie de l'information g\u00e9n\u00e9rale dans des conversations courtes \u00e0 l'\u00e9crit et \u00e0 l'oral concernant des conseils pour avoir une vie saine.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "L'apprenant identifie de l'information g\u00e9n\u00e9rale dans des conversations courtes \u00e0 l'\u00e9crit et \u00e0 l'oral concernant des conseils pour avoir une vie saine.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "L'apprenant identifie de l'information g\u00e9n\u00e9rale dans des conversations courtes \u00e0 l'\u00e9crit et \u00e0 l'oral concernant des conseils pour avoir une vie saine.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "L'apprenant identifie de l'information g\u00e9n\u00e9rale dans des conversations courtes \u00e0 l'\u00e9crit et \u00e0 l'oral concernant des conseils pour avoir une vie saine.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "L'apprenant identifie de l'information g\u00e9n\u00e9rale dans des conversations courtes \u00e0 l'\u00e9crit et \u00e0 l'oral concernant des conseils pour avoir une vie saine.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "L'apprenant identifie de l'information g\u00e9n\u00e9rale dans des conversations courtes \u00e0 l'\u00e9crit et \u00e0 l'oral concernant des conseils pour avoir une vie saine.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Les voyelles", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "D\u00e9couvrons les voyelles en fran\u00e7ais. Comment prononcez-vous les mots suivants ? <br/>Chaque mot a un son diff\u00e9rent.  ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ol><li>porte, pont, peau </li><li>lit, lu, loup </li><li>port, pur, p\u00e8re</li><li>me, mes, mais</li> <li>pas, pan, panne</li><li>du, doux, dos</li></ol><br/>Regardez les tableaux ci-dessous pour voir le classement phon\u00e9tique des voyelles du fran\u00e7ais.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":14,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Voyelles orales\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Exemples\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[i]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">y</span>, hab<span class=\\\"strong\\\">i</span>te\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[e]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"av<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ez</span>, pr<span class=\\\"strong\\\">\u00e9</span>f<span class=\\\"strong\\\">\u00e9</span>r<span class=\\\"strong\\\">\u00e9</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[\u025b]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"m<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ai</span>s, <span class=\\\"strong\\\">\u00ea</span>tre\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[a]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\u00e7<span class=\\\"strong\\\">a</span>, <span class=\\\"strong\\\">a</span>tt<span class=\\\"strong\\\">a</span>che\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[y]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"s<span class=\\\"strong\\\">\u00fb</span>r, v<span class=\\\"strong\\\">u</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[\u00f8]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"v<span class=\\\"strong\\\">eu</span>x, d<span class=\\\"strong\\\">eu</span>x\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[\u0259]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"l<span class=\\\"strong\\\">e</span>, c<span class=\\\"strong\\\">e</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[\u0153]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">\u0153u</span>f, n<span class=\\\"strong\\\">eu</span>f\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[u]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"l<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ou</span>p, <span class=\\\"strong\\\">o\u00f9</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[o]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"p<span class=\\\"strong\\\">o</span>t, <span class=\\\"strong\\\">eau</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[\u0254]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">o</span>s, b<span class=\\\"strong\\\">o</span>l\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[\u0251]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"b<span class=\\\"strong\\\">a</span>s, <span class=\\\"strong\\\">\u00e2</span>ge\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class = \"prelo-letter-page-break\"></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Voyelles nasales\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Exemples\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[\u025b\u0303]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"v<span class=\\\"strong\\\">in</span>, p<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ain</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[\u0251\u0303]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">en</span>cre, <span class=\\\"strong\\\">an</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[\u0153\u0303]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">un</span>, parf<span class=\\\"strong\\\">um</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[\u0254\u0303 ]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">on</span>, mais<span class=\\\"strong\\\">on</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Les semi-consonnes partagent les traits des voyelles et ceux des consonnes. C'est-\u00e0-dire, quand on les prononce, on entend le timbre d'une voyelle mais il faut un mouvement de la langue comme si on pronon\u00e7ait une consonne. Le tableau ci-dessous montre les trois semi-voyelles de la langue fran\u00e7aise.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Semi-voyelles\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Exemples\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[j]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"m<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ie</span>l, fil<span class=\\\"strong\\\">lle</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[w]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ou</span>i, r<span class=\\\"strong\\\">oi</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[\u0265\ufeff\ufeff]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"l<span class=\\\"strong\\\">u</span>i, n<span class=\\\"strong\\\">u</span>age\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"content": "frn4le05ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots que vous utilisez pour parler d'un festival.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "honorer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "rendre hommage \u00e0 une personne", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Depuis plus de 900 ans, les gens de Bu\u00f1ol honorent leur saint patron, Luis Beltran, lors d'un festival annuel.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn4le05ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "se d\u00e9cha\u00eener", "type": "name"}, {"content": "perdre contr\u00f4le", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Par contre, en 1957, la tradition s'est d\u00e9cha\u00een\u00e9e.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn4le05ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "le rite", "type": "name"}, {"content": "coutume ; habitude", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Maintenant, lancer des tomates en public est devenu une sorte de rite lors de ce festival du mois d'ao\u00fbt. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn4le05ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "la tradition", "type": "name"}, {"content": "coutumes transmises de g\u00e9n\u00e9ration en g\u00e9n\u00e9ration", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Des foules de touristes arrivent de partout dans le monde pour participer \u00e0 cette tradition inusit\u00e9e.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn4le05ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "la foule", "type": "name"}, {"content": "grand nombre de personnes r\u00e9unies en un m\u00eame lieu", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Des foules de touristes arrivent de partout dans le monde.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn4le05ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "inhabituel, inhabituelle", "type": "name"}, {"content": "rare", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Des foules de touristes arrivent de partout dans le monde pour participer \u00e0 cette tradition inhabituelle.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn4le05ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "m\u00fbr, m\u00fbre", "type": "name"}, {"content": "fruit qui est compl\u00e8tement d\u00e9velopp\u00e9", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ils se joignent aux 10 000 r\u00e9sidents de la ville en se lan\u00e7ant des tomates m\u00fbres.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn4le05ob04aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "je n'ai jamais vu quelque chose de pareil", "type": "name"}, {"content": "pour dire que quelque chose est rare ou bizarre ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Imaginez toutes les taches rouges ! Je n'ai jamais vu quelque chose de pareil ! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn4le05ob04aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Regardez le tableau ci-dessous.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Lisez chaque mot \u00e0 voix haute.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Compl\u00e9tez la table avec un mot additionnel dans chaque colonne. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choisissez un mot dans chaque colonne et \u00e9crivez une phrase en utilisant ce mot.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Lisez vos phrases \u00e0 votre camarade.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":7,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"beau\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"pur\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lit\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"mes\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"pas\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"loup\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"pas\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"trop\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"m\u00fbr\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"miroir\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"d\u00e9\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tas\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"beaucoup\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\u00e2ge\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bureau\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"dur\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"sirop\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"quai\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ananas\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"minou\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bas\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <br/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <br/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <br/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <br/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <br/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "J'identifie et prononce correctement les voyelles en fran\u00e7ais.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'identifie les mots ayant chaque son.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je distingue les voyelles dans une s\u00e9rie de mots.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "frn4le05ob04re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "frn4le05ob04re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "Voulez-vous \u00eatre rouge comme une tomate ? Venez au festival La Tomatina !<br/>\nQuand avez-vous eu la chance de lancer des tomates juste pour le plaisir ? Au festival La Tomatina \u00e0 Bu\u00f1ol en Espagne, c'est un geste normal."}, {"image": "frn4le05ob04re2img01.jpg", "time": "15250", "id": 2, "text": "Depuis plus de 900 ans, les gens de Bu\u00f1ol honorent leur saint patron, Luis Beltran, lors d'un festival annuel. En 1945, la tradition s'est d\u00e9cha\u00een\u00e9e."}, {"image": "frn4le05ob04re2img02.jpg", "time": "26500", "id": 3, "text": "Quelques amis ont commenc\u00e9 \u00e0 se lancer des tomates. Maintenant, lancer des tomates en public est devenu une sorte de rite lors de ce festival qui se passe le dernier mercredi du mois d'ao\u00fbt. Des foules de touristes arrivent de partout dans le monde pour participer \u00e0 cette tradition inhabituelle."}, {"image": "frn4le05ob04re2img02.jpg", "time": "45250", "id": 4, "text": "Les touristes se joignent aux 10 000 r\u00e9sidents de la ville en se lan\u00e7ant des tomates m\u00fbres, ce qui fait de la rue une v\u00e9ritable soupe de tomate ! Heureusement pour les r\u00e9sidents locaux, la c\u00e9l\u00e9bration inclut le nettoyage apr\u00e8s l'\u00e9v\u00e9nement.  Imaginez toutes les taches rouges !"}, {"image": "frn4le05ob04re2img02.jpg", "time": "61750", "id": 5, "text": "Je n'ai jamais vu quelque chose de pareil ! <br />\nQu'en pensez-vous ? Aimeriez-vous \u00eatre \u00e0 Bu\u00f1ol lors de ce festival ? Faites-moi parvenir vos commentaires.  <br/>\nCharlotte"}], "audiosrc": "frn4le05ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn4le05ob04re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Vocabulary and Grammar", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Je peux identifier et prononcer les voyelles correctement. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux parler de voyages et de coutumes. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Quelle tradition aimez-vous le plus de votre pays ou de votre ville ?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Quelles autres traditions connaissez-vous ?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Je peux donner des conseils \u00e0 quelqu'un.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade :", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Coin prononciation : On voyage en Espagne pour... Lancer des tomates&nbsp;!  ", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Charlotte lit son blog au sujet d'un festival espagnol. Est-ce que c'est <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">\u00e0 votre go\u00fbt</span> ?